        "jsCode": "// Payload\n// Logic below uses the shared library (OF.*) bundled at the end of this node.\nconst OF = __lib();\nreturn [{ json: { db: $input.first().json.body || {} } }];\n\nfunction __lib() { return {}; }\n"
